### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v2
@orderId = 696f8a9453701bba0abe0019
@userId = 696f611594fa5985e0fb5b28

### GET request to read all orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders

### GET request to read single order by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}

### POST request to create a new order
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{userId}}",
  "order_items": [
    {
      "product_id": "product_001",
      "type": "ready",
