### PATCH request to update order status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status_order": {
    "payment_status": "paid",
    "delivery_status": "shipped"
  }
}

### PATCH request to update order delivery method
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "delivery_option": {
    "delivery_id": "del_001",
    "name": "Thailand Post"
  },
  "payment_option": {
    "method": "Credit Card"
  }
}

### DELETE request to delete an order
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{orderId}}
